JT	00	INFO	FLATF	01:08:23.24	Outgoing command: Que Body(OC1COD1   SVR       OFI             \ofa:M\ofc:PSB\ofcl:Patient-specific Bins\ofd:Return to Pharmacy\ofl:Destination of DC / Discharged Meds -Inventory\ofn:Destination of DC or discharged meds during inventory functions. Applies to items removed from a PSB during modify bin or normal restock. Only applies to discontinued meds or meds for discharged patients. The selected option indicates the destination. This configuration option has no effect unless the cabinet is enabled for PSB support.\ofo:PSB_DC_DESTINTATION_INVENTORY\ofr:External Return Bin;Return to Pharmacy\oft:L\ofv:External Return Bin\osi:OC1COD1)
