JT	00	INFO	FLATF	01:08:23.94	Outgoing command: Que Body(OC1COD1   SVR       OFI             \ofa:M\ofc:PSB\ofcl:Patient-specific Bins\ofd:Single-Item Restocks\ofl:Normal Restock Default List\ofn:Indicates the default list shown to the user during normal restock. Single-item Restocks are restock lists for shared inventory items. Patient-specific Restocks are restock lists for items in patient-specific bins. This configuration option has no effect unless the cabinet is enabled for PSB support.\ofo:PSB_DEFAULT_RESTOCK_LIST\ofr:Single-Item Restocks;Patient-Specific Restocks\oft:L\ofv:Single-Item Restocks\osi:OC1COD1)
