JT	00	INFO	FLATF	01:08:24.81	Outgoing command: Que Body(OC1COD1   SVR       OFI             \ofa:M\ofc:PSB\ofcl:Patient-specific Bins\ofd:Enable\ofl:Receipt - Transfer Patient Meds\ofn:Print a receipt when items are removed from a PSB with reason of transfer patient meds. When one or more items are removed from a PSB a receipt will print, if enabled. Applies to items transferred with an active or future med order. If items are removed and the reason for removal is transfer patient meds, a receipt will print. This configuration option has no effect unless the cabinet is enabled for PSB support. \ofo:PSB_REMOVE_RECEIPT_TRANSFER\ofr:Enable;Disable\oft:L\ofv:Enable\osi:OC1COD1)
